---
{
  title: "settledp"
}
---
### NAME

    settledp() - Determine whether a promise has settled at all, without
    distinguishing which way it went. Use resolvedp(), rejectedp() or
    cancelledp() when the outcome matters.

### SYNOPSIS

    int settledp( promise p );

### DESCRIPTION

    Determine whether a promise has settled at all, without distinguishing
    which way it went. Use resolvedp(), rejectedp() or cancelledp() when the
    outcome matters.

### PARAMETERS

    p  (promise)
       The promise to test.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if the promise has resolved, rejected or been cancelled, 0 if it
    is still pending.
